# TMDB credentials. Create a free account at https://www.themoviedb.org/signup,
# then copy a credential from https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api.
#
# Either of these works; you only need one:
#   - "API Read Access Token" (the long one starting with "eyJ")
#   - "API Key" (32 characters)
TMDB_ACCESS_TOKEN=
